# 測試開發規範

## 測試金字塔
```
    E2E Tests (端到端測試)
         ↑
   Integration Tests (整合測試)
         ↑
    Unit Tests (單元測試)
```

## Python測試模式
```python
import pytest
from unittest.mock import Mock, patch, AsyncMock

class TestDiaryService:
    @pytest.fixture
    def mock_db(self):
        return Mock(spec=Session)
    
    @pytest.fixture
    def diary_service(self):
        return DiaryService(grok_client=AsyncMock())
    
    @pytest.mark.asyncio
    async def test_generate_diary_success(self, diary_service, mock_db):
        """測試成功場景"""
        # Arrange
        user_id = "test_user"
        expected_result = {"message": "success"}
        
        # Act
        result = await diary_service.generate_diary(user_id, mock_db)
        
        # Assert
        assert result["message"] == "success"
    
    @pytest.mark.asyncio
    async def test_generate_diary_validation_error(self, diary_service, mock_db):
        """測試驗證錯誤"""
        with pytest.raises(ValueError, match="用戶ID不能為空"):
            await diary_service.generate_diary("", mock_db)
```

## JavaScript測試模式
```javascript
describe('ChatModule', () => {
    beforeEach(() => {
        ChatModule.reset();
    });
    
    test('should validate empty message', () => {
        expect(() => {
            ChatModule.validateMessage('');
        }).toThrow('訊息不能為空');
    });
});
```

